sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Market A (e.g., HK)
    participant B as Market B (e.g., SG)
    participant C as Market C (e.g., CN)
    participant HUB as Regional Hub (HK/SG)

    Note over A,C: "Phase 1: Local Execution"

    A->>A: ① Load local full transaction details
    A->>A: ② Local rules engine executes AML screening<br/>(Large/Split/Cross-Border/Sensitive/Rapid In-Out)
    A->>A: ③ Local compute: Suspicious Tx Count/Risk Cust Count<br/>Risk Tier Dist/Cross-Border Suspicious Amt
    A->>A: ④ MPC node generates encrypted cust fingerprints (Secret Sharing)

    B->>B: ① Load local full transaction details
    B->>B: ② Local rules engine executes AML screening
    B->>B: ③ Local compute AML metrics
    B->>B: ④ MPC node generates encrypted cust fingerprints (Secret Sharing)

    C->>C: ① Load local full transaction details
    C->>C: ② Local rules engine executes AML screening
    C->>C: ③ Local compute AML metrics
    C->>C: ④ MPC node generates encrypted cust fingerprints (Secret Sharing)

    Note over A,HUB: "Phase 2: Encrypted Cross-Border Transfer"

    A->>HUB: AES-256 Encrypted Metrics + MPC Encrypted Shares
    B->>HUB: AES-256 Encrypted Metrics + MPC Encrypted Shares
    C->>HUB: AES-256 Encrypted Metrics + MPC Encrypted Shares

    Note over HUB: "Phase 3: Regional Aggregation"

    HUB->>HUB: ⑤ MPC ciphertext matching across market fingerprints
    HUB->>HUB: ⑥ Return ONLY: Cross-market linked risk count<br/>(NO customer details returned)
    HUB->>HUB: ⑦ Aggregate region-wide AML risk summary report

    Note over A,HUB: "No raw PII ever leaves jurisdiction"